  "plan": {
    "goal": "Co-incubate CYP2D6 with testosterone (65.9 µM, Km 90.1 µM) in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki 64.4 µM) at 69.5 µM and report the inhibitor:substrate ratio, fractional activity remaining, and run-condition IC50.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of CYP2D6-mediated testosterone hydroxylation. Substrate [S]=65.9 µM is below Km (90.1 µM), so the inhibitor at [I]=69.5 µM (Ki=64.4 µM) substantially suppresses activity. Fractional activity follows v_i/v_0 = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); run-condition IC50 follows Cheng-Prusoff IC50 = Ki(1+[S]/Km). Vmax (6.543 µmol/min) is the uninhibited maximum and does not enter these ratios.",
